                "content": "Neural Networks is:\n\nA programming technique\n\nA method used in machine learning\n\nA software that learns from mistakes\n\nNeural Networks are based on how the human brain works:\n\nNeurons are sending messages to each other.\nWhile the neurons are trying to solve a problem (over and over again),\nit is strengthening the connections that lead to success and diminishing the connections that lead to failure.",
