                "content": "Statistics\nDescriptive\nVariability\nDistribution\nProbability\n\nny:-->\n\n ny:-->\n\nny:-->\n\nBrain.js\n\n❮ Previous\nNext ❯\n\nBrain.js is a JavaScript library that makes it easy to understand Neural Networks\nbecause it hides the complexity of the mathematics.",
