                "content": "Example\n\nasync function trainModel(model, inputs, labels, surface) {\n\n  const batchSize = 25;\n\n  const epochs = 50;\n\n  const callbacks = tfvis.show.fitCallbacks(surface, ['loss'], {callbacks:['onEpochEnd']})\n\n  return await model.fit(inputs, labels,\n\n    {batchSize, epochs, shuffle:true, callbacks:callbacks}\n\n  );\n\n}\n\nTry it Yourself »\n\nepochs defines how many iterations (loops) the model will do.\n\nmodel.fit is the function that runs the loops.\n\ncallbacks defines the callback function to call\nwhen the model wants to redraw the graphics.",
                "heading": "Training Function"
