                "content": "Source Code\n\nlet exp = \"x + 17\";\n\n// Generate values\n\nconst xValues = [];\n\nconst yValues = [];\n\nfor (let x = 0; x <= 10; x += 1) {\n\n  yValues.push(eval(exp));\n\n  xValues.push(x);\n\n}\n\n// Define Data\n\nconst data = [{\n\n  x: xValues,\n\n  y: yValues,\n\n  mode: \"lines\"\n\n}];\n\n// Define Layout\n\nconst layout = {title: \"y = \" + exp};\n\n// Display using Plotly\n\nPlotly.newPlot(\"myPlot\", data, layout);\n\nTry it Yourself »",
