                "content": "A Function is special relationship where each input has an output.\n\nA function is often written as f(x) where x is the input:\n\nResults from f(x) = x\n\nxyy = x\n\n11y = x = 1\n\n22y = x = 2\n\n33y = x = 3\n\n44y = x = 4\n\n55y = x = 5\n\nResults from f(x) = 2x\n\nxyy = 2x\n\n12y = 2x = 2\n\n24y = 2x = 4\n\n36y = 2x = 6\n\n48y = 2x = 8\n\n510y = 2x = 10",
